<?php $attendance=acAttendance($r);?><section class="card sa-attendance"><h2>Attendance overview</h2><div class="stats"><div><small>DPD contact hours</small><strong><?=e($r['contact_hours'])?></strong></div><div><small>Recorded teaching hours</small><strong><?=$attendance['hours']?></strong></div><div><small>Extra class hours included</small><strong><?=$attendance['extra_hours']?></strong></div><div><small>Students</small><strong><?=count($attendance['students'])?></strong></div></div><p>Remarks use recorded-session attendance: present ÷ recorded sessions × 100, including extra classes. At least 90%: allowed; 80% to below 90%: supporting document and verification required; below 80%: not allowed. Present, Absent and Extra class are measured in one-hour periods; Present includes extra-class attendance. DPD percentage is retained for reference only.</p><?php if(!$attendance['complete']):?><p class="notice">Fewer teaching hours are recorded than prescribed in the DPD. This does not reduce recorded-session attendance. Ensure all conducted sessions have been uploaded.</p><?php elseif($attendance['hours']>(float)$r['contact_hours']):?><p class="notice">Recorded hours exceed the DPD hours. Extra attendance counts towards the fixed DPD hours; verify the contact-hour value.</p><?php endif;?><div class="table-wrap"><table class="ac-bordered sa-summary"><thead><tr><th>Sl. No.</th><th>Student</th><th>ID</th><th>Present</th><th>Absent</th><th>Extra class</th><th>Attendance % (DPD)</th><th>Recorded-session %</th><th>Remarks</th></tr></thead><tbody><?php foreach($attendance['students']as $index=>$s):?><tr class="<?=$s['recorded_percentage']<80?'sa-low':($s['recorded_percentage']<90?'sa-check':'sa-good')?>"><td><?=$index+1?></td><td><?=e($s['name'])?></td><td><?=e($s['id'])?></td><td><?=$s['present']?></td><td><?=$s['absent']?></td><td><?=$s['extra_present']?></td><td><?=e($s['percentage'])?>%</td><td><?=e($s['recorded_percentage'])?>%</td><td><span class="badge <?=$s['recorded_percentage']<80?'bad':($s['recorded_percentage']>=90?'good':'')?>"><?=e(saEligibility($r,$s))?></span></td></tr><?php endforeach;?></tbody></table></div><h3>Attendance register</h3><p class="muted">Scroll the register sideways to view further dates.</p><?php saMatrixHtml($r);?></section>
